BASELINES
---------
ors-wifi-manager.{h,cc} is our reimplementation of the ORS / SW-ORS / KL-R-UCB
algorithms of Combes, Proutiere et al., "Optimal Rate Sampling in 802.11 Systems"
(INFOCOM 2014). Any defect in it is ours, not theirs. See docs/ors_baseline.md.

ns-3 itself is NOT redistributed here. Fetch release 3.48 from https://www.nsnam.org/
and verify it against env/tarball.sha256.
